      },
      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_encoded_typeid_must_not_alias_source_typeid",
      "fine_trace_step": 6,
      "description": "Root cause. In the unknown-type `ExtensionObject` path, the decoded `NodeId` is shallow-copied into the destination instead of being duplicated or ownership-transferred. `ExtensionObject_decodeBinary()` later frees `binTypeId`, so `dst->content.encoded.typeId` becomes a dangling alias. The fix replaces this assignment with `UA_NodeId_copy(typeId, &dst->content.encoded.typeId);`."
    },
    {
